   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads — put each file in the ComfyUI folder shown\n\n**Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1** — https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n| ComfyUI folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | [qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 7.3 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 9.4 GB |\n| `models/vae/` | [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors) | 0.68 GB |\n\n**Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo** — only for the TURBO group — https://huggingface.co/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo\n\n| ComfyUI folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `models/loras/` | [Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo-v0.2.1-6step-lora-r256.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo-v0.2.1-6step-lora-r256.safetensors) | 1.4 GB |\n\n**Needs ComfyUI 0.37 or newer** (native Qwen Image 2.1 + the Comfy Kitchen attention node). **No custom nodes.**\n\nOptional: `qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors` (14.2 GB, same repo) is a drop-in swap for the int8 model. On my RTX 3060 at 2K it measured 6 min 10 s vs 3 min 57 s (25 steps) with 10.6 GB peak system RAM vs 3.0 GB — same-seed images looked the same.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Downloads — put each file in the ComfyUI folder shown\n\n**Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1** — https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n| ComfyUI folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | [qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 7.3 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 9.4 GB |\n| `models/vae/` | [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors) | 0.68 GB |\n\n**Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo** — only for the TURBO group — https://huggingface.co/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo\n\n| ComfyUI folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `models/loras/` | [Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo-v0.2.1-6step-lora-r256.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo-v0.2.1-6step-lora-r256.safetensors) | 1.4 GB |\n\n**Needs ComfyUI 0.37 or newer** (native Qwen Image 2.1 + the Comfy Kitchen attention node). **No custom nodes.**\n\nOptional: `qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors` (14.2 GB, same repo) is a drop-in swap for the int8 model. On my RTX 3060 at 2K it measured 6 min 10 s vs 3 min 57 s (25 steps) with 10.6 GB peak system RAM vs 3.0 GB — same-seed images looked the same.\n"
   },
